prime minister's death, Kenyans are reflecting on his contribution to democracy and national reconciliation. Odinga's "handshakes" with his political rivals remain the subject of much debate.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>EU summit to focus on China, Ukraine and bloc budget</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:1baabcb87f4335edce10dea497117b455eee20fa89617ec93372eeb9459556dc</id><updated>2026-10-16T04:44:16Z</updated><published>2026-10-15T14:37:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/eu-summit-to-focus-on-china-ukraine-and-bloc-budget/a-79665338--d6856904c849.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/eu-summit-to-focus-on-china-ukraine-and-bloc-budget/a-79665338?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">EU leaders meeting in Brussels will examine measures to curb the bloc's huge trade deficit with China. But they will also be looking to further agreement on the next EU budget ahead of some major elections next year.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Romania: 2 ships on fire in Black Sea, 7 crew missing</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:23a6ac03a9c439d16e2357121babe7422b3fdbe0e520228f15935efa30dbc5ab</id><updated>2026-10-16T04:44:16Z</updated><published>2026-10-15T14:34:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/romania-2-ships-on-fire-in-black-sea-7-crew-missing/a-79667003--b330bc2c57d8.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/romania-2-ships-on-fire-in-black-sea-7-crew-missing/a-79667003?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Two chemical tankers have caught fire in Romanian territorial waters in the Black Sea. The blazes occurred after Russian drones were sighted in Romanian airspace.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>Starlink: How Elon Musk's company influences geopolitics</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:04220ca083801c7ac45b7ce0292f014ade3addde7969c1a62209c616847c8e93</id><updated>2026-10-16T04:44:16Z</updated><published>2026-10-15T12:59:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/starlink-how-elon-musk-s-company-influences-geopolitics/a-75963477--2578f6b76007.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/starlink-how-elon-musk-s-company-influences-geopolitics/a-75963477?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Designed to bring internet access to remote regions, Elon Musk's Starlink has become vital in crisis regions and war zones. But Ukraine also shows the risks of depending on the service.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Hypersonic missiles highlight arms race on Korean Peninsula</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:0774574e7a3adac6e9f42b9b81dd5bb81812147137ce0655c4fd1f1ef03d5fe4</id><updated>2026-10-16T04:44:16Z</updated><published>2026-10-15T12:02:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/hypersonic-missiles-highlight-arms-race-on-korean-peninsula/a-79667084--2f8077093613.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/hypersonic-missiles-highlight-arms-race-on-korean-peninsula/a-79667084?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Both South and North Korea have tested weapons feared by military planners for their speed and ability to maneuver in flight.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Brazil's elections matter for the planet. This is why</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:e62e733247997fe53abf273b4b1214bf8b0af796cbb38c8f4139fa65aa432626</id><updated>2026-10-16T04:44:16Z</updated><published>2026-10-15T09:52:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/brazil-s-elections-matter-for-the-planet-this-is-why/a-79659928--00329e582e5d.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/brazil-s-elections-matter-for-the-planet-this-is-why/a-79659928?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Brazil is heading back to the polls, but the impact could be felt worldwide. With the Amazon vital to the health of the planet, the election could help shape its future.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>North Korea, China open border bridge after 12-year delay</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:d6578d83227b482b411f0f99a99a73b3c2457745d1fab4a1547e0b3f7662c14b</id><updated>2026-10-16T04:44:16Z</updated><published>2026-10-15T08:12:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/north-korea-china-open-border-bridge-after-12-year-delay/a-79666112--b02034e8a849.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/north-korea-china-open-border-bridge-after-12-year-delay/a-79666112?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Twelve years after it was constructed, the New Yalu River Bridge between China and North Korea is finally operational. It is the latest sign of warming ties between the two nations.</summary><category term="News" /></entry><entry><title>India urges Russia, Ukraine to protect Black Sea shipping</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:5c2056dc09473bb557111de75ce13c5880a3289dc7fc3a94348c8d84d9a19089</id><updated>2026-10-16T04:44:16Z</updated><published>2026-10-15T04:19:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/india-urges-russia-ukraine-to-protect-black-sea-shipping/a-79662826--4fbe6c552799.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/india-urges-russia-ukraine-to-protect-black-sea-shipping/a-79662826?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">New Delhi wants Moscow and Kyiv to ensure safe commercial shipping in the Black Sea amid attacks that put Indian seafarers at risk.</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>How Trump's diesel deal with Russia will impact the United States and Ukraine</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:9704cd4bf14f4ad9a97f5481938f8e6bfc268abf636355c471f50ac428150775</id><updated>2026-10-16T04:44:16Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T17:55:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/how-trump-s-diesel-deal-with-russia-will-impact-the-united-states-and-ukraine/a-79658596--f95bfc6ecbf1.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/how-trump-s-diesel-deal-with-russia-will-impact-the-united-states-and-ukraine/a-79658596?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">US President Trump's diesel deal with Russia has alarmed Ukraine and its allies. What is he hoping to achieve at home, and what does the deal mean for Kyiv and Moscow?</summary><category term="World" /></entry><entry><title>Albania: Fire at Education Ministry as students protest</title><id>urn:rssync:entry:29163323c74e90fd46b9d3abd1fcfa834af0084649c947e738ab1f13dda0d21a</id><updated>2026-10-16T04:44:16Z</updated><published>2026-10-14T14:56:00Z</published><link rel="alternate" href="../../../pages/www.dw.com/en/albania-fire-at-education-ministry-as-students-protest/a-79661193--fb85f85aef8b.html" type="text/html" /><link rel="via" href="https://www.dw.com/en/albania-fire-at-education-ministry-as-students-protest/a-79661193?maca=en-rss-en-world-4025-xml-mrss" /><summary type="html">Riot police deployed in the Albanian capital Tirana on the second day of student protests. The sudden outbreak seemed at least somewhat reminiscent of the widespread demos in France courting international attention.</summary><category term="News" /></entry></feed>
